mapping "V8822.1" source="V8822" target="214640008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V88.2+activity SNOMED CT 214640008 36198007 = person injured in collision between car and
        light truck, nontraffic, while working. Parent ICD-10 V88.2 (45756188) Athena-crosswalks to
        SNOMED CT 437738 (Motor vehicle accident off public road, 214640008) and 444074 (Victim of
        vehicular AND/OR traffic accident, 36198007). Target 437738 captures the nontraffic
        motor-vehicle-accident core but drops vehicle-pair specificity and the activity context —
        broader (subsumes accident type, drops orthogonal activity metadata). 444074 is the even-broader
        vehicular-accictim concept. Activity suffix has no SNOMED CT equivalent. (verified crosswalk,
        one-level broader) for primary; for secondary.
        """
}
